{"route":"/docs/4.5/content/reboot/","version":"4.5","renderedVersion":"4.5","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Reboot","level":1},"lead":{"id":"page--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<a href=\"https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/blob/v4.5.3/site/docs/4.5/content/reboot.md\">View on GitHub</a>"},"blocks":[{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Reboot, a collection of element-specific CSS changes in a single file, kickstart Bootstrap to provide an elegant, consistent, and simple baseline to build upon."},{"id":"approach","type":"heading","en":"Approach","level":2},{"id":"approach--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Reboot builds upon Normalize, providing many HTML elements with somewhat opinionated styles using only element selectors. Additional styling is done only with classes. For example, we reboot some <code>&lt;table&gt;</code> styles for a simpler baseline and later provide <code>.table</code>, <code>.table-bordered</code>, and more."},{"id":"approach--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Here are our guidelines and reasons for choosing what to override in Reboot:"},{"id":"approach--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"approach--item-1","type":"item","en":"Update some browser default values to use <code>rem</code>s instead of <code>em</code>s for scalable component spacing."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"approach--item-2","type":"item","en":"Avoid <code>margin-top</code>. Vertical margins can collapse, yielding unexpected results. More importantly though, a single direction of <code>margin</code> is a simpler mental model."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"approach--item-3","type":"item","en":"For easier scaling across device sizes, block elements should use <code>rem</code>s for <code>margin</code>s."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"approach--item-4","type":"item","en":"Keep declarations of <code>font</code>-related properties to a minimum, using <code>inherit</code> whenever possible."}]}]},{"id":"page-defaults","type":"heading","en":"Page defaults","level":2},{"id":"page-defaults--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"The <code>&lt;html&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;body&gt;</code> elements are updated to provide better page-wide defaults. More specifically:"},{"id":"page-defaults--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"page-defaults--item-1","type":"item","en":"The <code>box-sizing</code> is globally set on every element—including <code>*::before</code> and <code>*::after</code>, to <code>border-box</code>. This ensures that the declared width of element is never exceeded due to padding or border."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"page-defaults--item-2","type":"item","en":"No base <code>font-size</code> is declared on the <code>&lt;html&gt;</code>, but <code>16px</code> is assumed (the browser default). <code>font-size: 1rem</code> is applied on the <code>&lt;body&gt;</code> for easy responsive type-scaling via media queries while respecting user preferences and ensuring a more accessible approach."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"page-defaults--item-3","type":"item","en":"The <code>&lt;body&gt;</code> also sets a global <code>font-family</code>, <code>line-height</code>, and <code>text-align</code>. This is inherited later by some form elements to prevent font inconsistencies."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"page-defaults--item-4","type":"item","en":"For safety, the <code>&lt;body&gt;</code> has a declared <code>background-color</code>, defaulting to <code>#fff</code>."}]}]},{"id":"native-font-stack","type":"heading","en":"Native font stack","level":2},{"id":"native-font-stack--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"The default web fonts (Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, and Arial) have been dropped in Bootstrap 4 and replaced with a “native font stack” for optimum text rendering on every device and OS. Read more about <a href=\"https://www.smashingmagazine.com/2015/11/using-system-ui-fonts-practical-guide/\">native font stacks in this <em>Smashing Magazine</em> article</a>."},{"id":"native-font-stack--code-1","type":"code","value":"$font-family-sans-serif:\n  // Safari for macOS and iOS (San Francisco)\n  -apple-system,\n  // Chrome < 56 for macOS (San Francisco)\n  BlinkMacSystemFont,\n  // Windows\n  \"Segoe UI\",\n  // Android\n  Roboto,\n  // Basic web fallback\n  \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial,\n  // Linux\n  \"Noto Sans\",\n  // Sans serif fallback\n  sans-serif,\n  // Emoji fonts\n  \"Apple Color Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Symbol\", \"Noto Color Emoji\" !default;","language":"sass"},{"id":"native-font-stack--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"This <code>font-family</code> is applied to the <code>&lt;body&gt;</code> and automatically inherited globally throughout Bootstrap. To switch the global <code>font-family</code>, update <code>$font-family-base</code> and recompile Bootstrap."},{"id":"headings-and-paragraphs","type":"heading","en":"Headings and paragraphs","level":2},{"id":"headings-and-paragraphs--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"All heading elements—e.g., <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code>—and <code>&lt;p&gt;</code> are reset to have their <code>margin-top</code> removed. Headings have <code>margin-bottom: .5rem</code> added and paragraphs <code>margin-bottom: 1rem</code> for easy spacing."},{"id":"headings-and-paragraphs--table-1","type":"table","caption":[],"rows":[{"head":true,"cells":[{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"headings-and-paragraphs--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Heading"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"headings-and-paragraphs--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Example"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"headings-and-paragraphs--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>&lt;h1&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"headings-and-paragraphs--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"h1. Bootstrap heading"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"headings-and-paragraphs--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>&lt;h2&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"headings-and-paragraphs--paragraph-7","type":"paragraph","en":"h2. Bootstrap heading"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"headings-and-paragraphs--paragraph-8","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>&lt;h3&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"headings-and-paragraphs--paragraph-9","type":"paragraph","en":"h3. Bootstrap heading"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"headings-and-paragraphs--paragraph-10","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>&lt;h4&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"headings-and-paragraphs--paragraph-11","type":"paragraph","en":"h4. Bootstrap heading"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"headings-and-paragraphs--paragraph-12","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>&lt;h5&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"headings-and-paragraphs--paragraph-13","type":"paragraph","en":"h5. Bootstrap heading"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"headings-and-paragraphs--paragraph-14","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>&lt;h6&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"headings-and-paragraphs--paragraph-15","type":"paragraph","en":"h6. Bootstrap heading"}]}]}]},{"id":"lists","type":"heading","en":"Lists","level":2},{"id":"lists--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"All lists—<code>&lt;ul&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;ol&gt;</code>, and <code>&lt;dl&gt;</code>—have their <code>margin-top</code> removed and a <code>margin-bottom: 1rem</code>. Nested lists have no <code>margin-bottom</code>."},{"id":"lists--example-1","type":"demo","key":"f74559522b3c8d0731c5","height":174},{"id":"lists--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"For simpler styling, clear hierarchy, and better spacing, description lists have updated <code>margin</code>s. <code>&lt;dd&gt;</code>s reset <code>margin-left</code> to <code>0</code> and add <code>margin-bottom: .5rem</code>. <code>&lt;dt&gt;</code>s are <strong>bolded</strong>."},{"id":"lists--example-2","type":"demo","key":"2a2b754a1b18917cc1dc","height":147},{"id":"preformatted-text","type":"heading","en":"Preformatted text","level":2},{"id":"preformatted-text--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"The <code>&lt;pre&gt;</code> element is reset to remove its <code>margin-top</code> and use <code>rem</code> units for its <code>margin-bottom</code>."},{"id":"preformatted-text--example-1","type":"demo","key":"e9396c9e0754371c1aa1","height":147},{"id":"tables","type":"heading","en":"Tables","level":2},{"id":"tables--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Tables are slightly adjusted to style <code>&lt;caption&gt;</code>s, collapse borders, and ensure consistent <code>text-align</code> throughout. Additional changes for borders, padding, and more come with <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/content/tables/\">the <code>.table</code> class</a>."},{"id":"tables--example-1","type":"demo","key":"f4fbb47c80fb7bfeb9e7","height":147},{"id":"forms","type":"heading","en":"Forms","level":2},{"id":"forms--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Various form elements have been rebooted for simpler base styles. Here are some of the most notable changes:"},{"id":"forms--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"forms--item-1","type":"item","en":"<code>&lt;fieldset&gt;</code>s have no borders, padding, or margin so they can be easily used as wrappers for individual inputs or groups of inputs."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"forms--item-2","type":"item","en":"<code>&lt;legend&gt;</code>s, like fieldsets, have also been restyled to be displayed as a heading of sorts."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"forms--item-3","type":"item","en":"<code>&lt;label&gt;</code>s are set to <code>display: inline-block</code> to allow <code>margin</code> to be applied."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"forms--item-4","type":"item","en":"<code>&lt;input&gt;</code>s, <code>&lt;select&gt;</code>s, <code>&lt;textarea&gt;</code>s, and <code>&lt;button&gt;</code>s are mostly addressed by Normalize, but Reboot removes their <code>margin</code> and sets <code>line-height: inherit</code>, too."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"forms--item-5","type":"item","en":"<code>&lt;textarea&gt;</code>s are modified to only be resizable vertically as horizontal resizing often “breaks” page layout."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"forms--item-6","type":"item","en":"<code>&lt;button&gt;</code>s and <code>&lt;input&gt;</code> button elements have <code>cursor: pointer</code> when <code>:not(:disabled)</code>."}]}]},{"id":"forms--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"These changes, and more, are demonstrated below."},{"id":"forms--example-1","type":"demo","key":"54731407580b8fa9a97a","height":147,"anchors":["input","select","optionsRadios1","optionsRadios2","optionsRadios3","textarea","date","time","output"]},{"id":"pointers-on-buttons","type":"heading","en":"Pointers on buttons","level":3},{"id":"pointers-on-buttons--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Reboot includes an enhancement for <code>role=&quot;button&quot;</code> to change the default cursor to <code>pointer</code>. Add this attribute to elements to help indicate elements are interactive. This role isn’t necessary for <code>&lt;button&gt;</code> elements, which get their own <code>cursor</code> change."},{"id":"pointers-on-buttons--example-1","type":"demo","key":"7e6f1fd91029dca74fda","height":147},{"id":"pointers-on-buttons--code-1","type":"code","value":"<span role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\">Non-button element button</span>","language":"html"},{"id":"misc-elements","type":"heading","en":"Misc elements","level":2},{"id":"address","type":"heading","en":"Address","level":3},{"id":"address--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"The <code>&lt;address&gt;</code> element is updated to reset the browser default <code>font-style</code> from <code>italic</code> to <code>normal</code>. <code>line-height</code> is also now inherited, and <code>margin-bottom: 1rem</code> has been added. <code>&lt;address&gt;</code>s are for presenting contact information for the nearest ancestor (or an entire body of work). Preserve formatting by ending lines with <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>."},{"id":"address--example-1","type":"demo","key":"c1ed58718dc404db576c","height":174},{"id":"blockquote","type":"heading","en":"Blockquote","level":3},{"id":"blockquote--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"The default <code>margin</code> on blockquotes is <code>1em 40px</code>, so we reset that to <code>0 0 1rem</code> for something more consistent with other elements."},{"id":"blockquote--example-1","type":"demo","key":"c72f54433c80b8272407","height":147},{"id":"inline-elements","type":"heading","en":"Inline elements","level":3},{"id":"inline-elements--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"The <code>&lt;abbr&gt;</code> element receives basic styling to make it stand out amongst paragraph text."},{"id":"inline-elements--example-1","type":"demo","key":"19385431bcc62cd6fd9c","height":147},{"id":"summary","type":"heading","en":"Summary","level":3},{"id":"summary--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"The default <code>cursor</code> on summary is <code>text</code>, so we reset that to <code>pointer</code> to convey that the element can be interacted with by clicking on it."},{"id":"summary--example-1","type":"demo","key":"cf774d9a3178f7b10764","height":174},{"id":"html5-hidden-attribute","type":"heading","en":"HTML5 <code>[hidden]</code> attribute","level":2},{"id":"html5-hidden-attribute--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"HTML5 adds <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Global_attributes/hidden\">a new global attribute named <code>[hidden]</code></a>, which is styled as <code>display: none</code> by default. Borrowing an idea from <a href=\"https://purecss.io/\">PureCSS</a>, we improve upon this default by making <code>[hidden] { display: none !important; }</code> to help prevent its <code>display</code> from getting accidentally overridden. While <code>[hidden]</code> isn’t natively supported by IE10, the explicit declaration in our CSS gets around that problem."},{"id":"html5-hidden-attribute--code-1","type":"code","value":"<input type=\"text\" hidden>","language":"html"},{"id":"html5-hidden-attribute--note-1","type":"note","tone":"warning","body":[{"id":"jquery-incompatibility","type":"heading","en":"jQuery incompatibility","level":5},{"id":"jquery-incompatibility--note-text-1","type":"note-text","en":"<code>[hidden]</code> is not compatible with jQuery’s <code>$(...).hide()</code> and <code>$(...).show()</code> methods. Therefore, we don’t currently especially endorse <code>[hidden]</code> over other techniques for managing the <code>display</code> of elements."}]},{"id":"jquery-incompatibility--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"To merely toggle the visibility of an element, meaning its <code>display</code> is not modified and the element can still affect the flow of the document, use <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/utilities/visibility/\">the <code>.invisible</code> class</a> instead."}],"demos":[{"key":"f74559522b3c8d0731c5","html":"\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet</li>\n  <li>Consectetur adipiscing elit</li>\n  <li>Integer molestie lorem at massa</li>\n  <li>Facilisis in pretium nisl aliquet</li>\n  <li>Nulla volutpat aliquam velit\n    <ul>\n      <li>Phasellus iaculis neque</li>\n      <li>Purus sodales ultricies</li>\n      <li>Vestibulum laoreet porttitor sem</li>\n      <li>Ac tristique libero volutpat at</li>\n    </ul>\n  </li>\n  <li>Faucibus porta lacus fringilla vel</li>\n  <li>Aenean sit amet erat nunc</li>\n  <li>Eget porttitor lorem</li>\n</ul>\n\n<ol>\n  <li>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet</li>\n  <li>Consectetur adipiscing elit</li>\n  <li>Integer molestie lorem at massa</li>\n  <li>Facilisis in pretium nisl aliquet</li>\n  <li>Nulla volutpat aliquam velit</li>\n  <li>Faucibus porta lacus fringilla vel</li>\n  <li>Aenean sit amet erat nunc</li>\n  <li>Eget porttitor lorem</li>\n</ol>\n\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"2a2b754a1b18917cc1dc","html":"\n  <dl>\n    <dt>Description lists</dt>\n    <dd>A description list is perfect for defining terms.</dd>\n    <dt>Euismod</dt>\n    <dd>Vestibulum id ligula porta felis euismod semper eget lacinia odio sem.</dd>\n    <dd>Donec id elit non mi porta gravida at eget metus.</dd>\n    <dt>Malesuada porta</dt>\n    <dd>Etiam porta sem malesuada magna mollis euismod.</dd>\n  </dl>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"e9396c9e0754371c1aa1","html":"\n<pre>.example-element {\n  margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n</pre>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"f4fbb47c80fb7bfeb9e7","html":"\n  <table>\n    <caption>\n      This is an example table, and this is its caption to describe the contents.\n    </caption>\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>Table heading</th>\n        <th>Table heading</th>\n        <th>Table heading</th>\n        <th>Table heading</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Table cell</td>\n        <td>Table cell</td>\n        <td>Table cell</td>\n        <td>Table cell</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Table cell</td>\n        <td>Table cell</td>\n        <td>Table cell</td>\n        <td>Table cell</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Table cell</td>\n        <td>Table cell</td>\n        <td>Table cell</td>\n        <td>Table cell</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"54731407580b8fa9a97a","html":"\n  <fieldset>\n    <legend>Example legend</legend>\n\n    <p>\n      <label for=\"input\">Example input</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"input\" placeholder=\"Example input\">\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n      <label for=\"select\">Example select</label>\n      <select id=\"select\">\n        <option value=\"\">Choose...</option>\n        <optgroup label=\"Option group 1\">\n          <option value=\"\">Option 1</option>\n          <option value=\"\">Option 2</option>\n          <option value=\"\">Option 3</option>\n        </optgroup>\n        <optgroup label=\"Option group 2\">\n          <option value=\"\">Option 4</option>\n          <option value=\"\">Option 5</option>\n          <option value=\"\">Option 6</option>\n        </optgroup>\n      </select>\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"\">\n        Check this checkbox\n      </label>\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"optionsRadios\" id=\"optionsRadios1\" value=\"option1\" checked=\"\">\n        Option one is this and that\n      </label>\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"optionsRadios\" id=\"optionsRadios2\" value=\"option2\">\n        Option two is something else that's also super long to demonstrate the wrapping of these fancy form controls.\n      </label>\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"optionsRadios\" id=\"optionsRadios3\" value=\"option3\" disabled=\"\">\n        Option three is disabled\n      </label>\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n      <label for=\"textarea\">Example textarea</label>\n      <textarea id=\"textarea\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n      <label for=\"date\">Example date</label>\n      <input type=\"date\" id=\"date\">\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n      <label for=\"time\">Example time</label>\n      <input type=\"time\" id=\"time\">\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n      <label for=\"output\">Example output</label>\n      <output name=\"result\" id=\"output\">100</output>\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n      <button type=\"submit\">Button submit</button>\n      <input type=\"submit\" value=\"Input submit button\">\n      <input type=\"reset\" value=\"Input reset button\">\n      <input type=\"button\" value=\"Input button\">\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n      <button type=\"submit\" disabled=\"\">Button submit</button>\n      <input type=\"submit\" value=\"Input submit button\" disabled=\"\">\n      <input type=\"reset\" value=\"Input reset button\" disabled=\"\">\n      <input type=\"button\" value=\"Input button\" disabled=\"\">\n    </p>\n  </fieldset>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"7e6f1fd91029dca74fda","html":"\n<span role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\">Non-button element button</span>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"c1ed58718dc404db576c","html":"\n  <address>\n    <strong>Twitter, Inc.</strong><br>\n    1355 Market St, Suite 900<br>\n    San Francisco, CA 94103<br>\n    <abbr title=\"Phone\">P:</abbr> (123) 456-7890\n  </address>\n\n  <address>\n    <strong>Full Name</strong><br>\n    <a href=\"mailto:first.last@example.com\">first.last@example.com</a>\n  </address>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"c72f54433c80b8272407","html":"\n  <blockquote class=\"blockquote\">\n    <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Integer posuere erat a ante.</p>\n    <footer>Someone famous in <cite title=\"Source Title\">Source Title</cite></footer>\n  </blockquote>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"19385431bcc62cd6fd9c","html":"\n  Nulla <abbr title=\"attribute\">attr</abbr> vitae elit libero, a pharetra augue.\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"cf774d9a3178f7b10764","html":"\n  <details>\n    <summary>Some details</summary>\n    <p>More info about the details.</p>\n  </details>\n\n  <details open=\"\">\n    <summary>Even more details</summary>\n    <p>Here are even more details about the details.</p>\n  </details>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Getting started","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/download/"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/contents/"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.